<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS1" title="In 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.1 </span>Parallel-Sequential Contradictions cause superficial parallel reasoning.</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="In 3.1 Parallel-Sequential Contradictions cause superficial parallel reasoning. ‣ 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Parallel-Sequential Contradictions cause superficial parallel reasoning in simple scenarios.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In 3.1 Parallel-Sequential Contradictions cause superficial parallel reasoning. ‣ 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">For complex reasoning, DLLMs converge toward autoregressive-like behavior to avoid PSC.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS2" title="In 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.2 </span>Diffusion-Step Dilemma: Sacrificing Efficiency Under PSC</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS0.Px1" title="In 3.2 Diffusion-Step Dilemma: Sacrificing Efficiency Under PSC ‣ 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">When complex reasoning, DLLMs require significantly more diffusion steps than ALLMs.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 3.2 Diffusion-Step Dilemma: Sacrificing Efficiency Under PSC ‣ 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">In reasoning scenarios, a large number of diffusion steps for autoregressive reasoning is unavoidable for acceptable accuracy.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS3" title="In 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.3 </span>Rethinking the prompting strategies in DLLMs from PSC perspective</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In 3.3 Rethinking the prompting strategies in DLLMs from PSC perspective ‣ 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Sequential Reasoning Prompting will enlarge PSC’s negative impact for DLLMs.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 3.3 Rethinking the prompting strategies in DLLMs from PSC perspective ‣ 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Constraint-guided Reasoning Prompting enhances model performance by preventing the introduction of additional PSC.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 3.3 Rethinking the prompting strategies in DLLMs from PSC perspective ‣ 3 Do DLLMs truely perform parallel reasoning that avoids PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Parallel-encouraging Prompting reduces the sequential feature so that it further improves performance.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4 </span>What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC?</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS1" title="In 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.1 </span>DLLMs do not have sufficient basic capabilities to support Long CoT.</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="In 4.1 DLLMs do not have sufficient basic capabilities to support Long CoT. ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Traditional reflection strategies are Ineffective for DLLMs.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.1 DLLMs do not have sufficient basic capabilities to support Long CoT. ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limited Efficacy of traditional exploration strategies for novel reasoning path generation.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.1 DLLMs do not have sufficient basic capabilities to support Long CoT. ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DLLMs possess limited reasoning boundaries and, consequently, exhibit restricted deep reasoning abilities.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2 </span>Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS1" title="In 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2.1 </span>Parallel Scaling Law holds Despite PSC</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS1.Px1" title="In 4.2.1 Parallel Scaling Law holds Despite PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Higher temperatures do not always yield more diverse and effective parallel sampling.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS1.Px2" title="In 4.2.1 Parallel Scaling Law holds Despite PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DLLM reasoning accuracy improves with increased parallel samples, following inference-time scaling patterns.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS2" title="In 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2.2 </span>Diffusion Scaling Law is Broken and Constrained by PSC</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS2.Px1" title="In 4.2.2 Diffusion Scaling Law is Broken and Constrained by PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Diffusion Scaling of DLLMs ensures performance gains, with diffusion time positively correlated.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS2.Px2" title="In 4.2.2 Diffusion Scaling Law is Broken and Constrained by PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Diffusion Scaling is effective and exhibits an upper bound, beyond which an over-diffusion phenomenon emerges due to PSC.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS2.Px3" title="In 4.2.2 Diffusion Scaling Law is Broken and Constrained by PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Early stopping can effectively mitigate over-diffusion.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS3" title="In 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2.3 </span>Sequential Scaling Law is also Broken and Constrained by PSC</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS3.Px1" title="In 4.2.3 Sequential Scaling Law is also Broken and Constrained by PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The inherent limitations of sequential scaling for DLLMs.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS3.Px2" title="In 4.2.3 Sequential Scaling Law is also Broken and Constrained by PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Sequential Scaling also meets over-thinking challenges.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS3.Px3" title="In 4.2.3 Sequential Scaling Law is also Broken and Constrained by PSC ‣ 4.2 Current DLLMs have three-directional but limited Inference-Time Scaling ‣ 4 What challenges do DLLMs meet in Long CoT based on PSC? ‣ Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Diffusion Scaling can naturally yield Sequential Scaling benefits.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
