<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Beyond Surface Reasoning: Unveiling the True Long Chain-of-Thought Capacity of Diffusion Large Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
